sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Reader
  participant Unluminate
  participant Disk as The disk
  Reader ->>+ Unluminate: Open notes.md
  Unluminate ->>+ Disk: Read it
  Disk -->>- Unluminate: The bytes
  Note right of Unluminate: nothing is fetched
  loop every keystroke
    Unluminate ->> Unluminate: Lay the preview out
  end
  alt it parsed
    Unluminate -->>- Reader: The drawn page
  else it did not
    Unluminate --x Reader: The line it went wrong on
  end
